From fa947d9540f0cd786a3871bc77eaecf1db7aa469 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:47:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Showcase Bollywood with an immersive Hindi cinema
 explorer

- Add frontend/bollywood-explorer/ covering history, timeline, famous
  movies, legendary actors, major directors, music composers, awards,
  gallery and references, following the site's existing cinema-explorer
  template (as used by tollywood-explorer, chhollywood-cinema-explorer, etc.)
- Add a 'Bollywood (Hindi Cinema)' link to the shared Culture nav dropdown
  on the sibling cinema explorer pages
- Register the new explorer in the site-wide search index

Closes #1777
